      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei tells Feng Jin Huang that Fang Yuan is a wanted criminal listed on the Demon Judgment Board by Heavenly Court, and sets that listing as a limit on any repayment of kindness tied to Hu Immortal blessed land.",
